    "enUS": {
      "description": "There is an ornate, well-traveled bridge\nEast of Deadwind and south of Redridge\nUnderneath there waits something for you\nSome call it a hint, others a clue\nThere it will lie for endless tomorrows\nBiding its time in the Swamp of Sorrows",
      "summary": "Solve the riddle!",
      "title": "Cortello's Riddle",
      "translationMetadata": {
